---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About Dinkly — a small studio making tiny breaks"
  description="Dinkly is an independent, ad-supported micro-break site. Here's what we make, why we make it, and what we do with your data (nothing)."
>
  <div class="wrap narrow page">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span>About</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="head">
      <span class="kicker">✦ Independent · ad-supported</span>
      <h1>We make tiny breaks.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Dinkly exists for one specific moment: the ninety seconds after you ask a machine for something,
        before it answers. It is not a productivity tool, and it is not a feed.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What this is</h2>
      <p>
        A small collection of self-contained things you can finish in under three minutes: a daily card,
        three 60-second quizzes, a jar of jokes, an oracle, four generated ambient rooms, a memory game,
        a handful of wallpapers, and some short writing about attention.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every one of these has a <strong>finish line</strong>. That is the design constraint. If something
        cannot end, it does not belong here — which is why there is no infinite feed, no autoplay,
        and no "more like this" carousel.
      </p>

      <h2>How it stays free</h2>
      <p>
        Advertising. There are a small number of clearly-labelled slots per page, and native placements
        are marked as <em>Sponsored</em>. There are no pop-ups, no interstitials that block the content,
        no auto-playing video ads, and no audio advertising. The sounds page contains no ads inside the audio.
      </p>
      <p>
        We would rather have fewer, better-placed placements than the maximum the format allows.
        If you want to advertise here, see <a href="/advertise/">Advertise</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we do with your data</h2>
      <p>
        Almost nothing. There is no account system, no email collection, no newsletter nag.
        Quiz results, game best-times and your daily draw are stored in your own browser's local storage
        and never transmitted to us — which also means clearing your browser data clears them.
        Full detail lives in the <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>How the content is made</h2>
      <p>
        The cards, jokes, quiz results and essays are written by hand. The ambient sounds and wallpapers
        are generated at runtime in your browser rather than shipped as files, which is why the site
        loads quickly and works with almost no bandwidth.
      </p>

      <h2>Languages</h2>
      <p>
        Dinkly is English-first. Spanish and Portuguese versions are planned for a later phase,
        because "the two minutes you spend waiting" turns out to be a fairly universal experience.
      </p>

      <div class="contact">
        <h3>Get in touch</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Editorial corrections, partnership enquiries, and advertising questions are all welcome.
          We are a small team, so replies can take a couple of days.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/advertise/">Advertising enquiries</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="more">
      <h2>Start somewhere</h2>
      <div class="more-grid">
        <a class="more-card" href="/daily-draw/"><span aria-hidden="true">🎴</span><h3>Daily Draw</h3><p>Today's card, same for everybody.</p></a>
        <a class="more-card" href="/blog/">   <span aria-hidden="true">📓</span><h3>Break Notes</h3><p>Essays on attention and micro-breaks.</p></a>
        <a class="more-card" href="/privacy-policy/"><span aria-hidden="true">🔒</span><h3>Privacy Policy</h3><p>The short version: we collect nothing.</p></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 820px; }
  .page { padding: 34px 0 20px; }
  .crumbs { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--faint); display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .crumbs a { color: var(--muted); }
  .crumbs a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .head { margin: 28px 0 34px; }
  .head h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 50px); margin: 16px 0 14px; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }

  .prose { font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.78; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 25px; margin: 40px 0 12px; }
  .prose h3 { font-size: 19px; margin: 26px 0 8px; }
  .prose p { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .prose a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, transparent); }
  .contact { margin-top: 40px; padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--r-lg); background: var(--bg-soft); border: 1px solid var(--border); }

  .more { margin-top: 56px; }
  .more h2 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .more-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .more-card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 22px; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease; }
  .more-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .more-card span { font-size: 24px; }
  .more-card h3 { font-size: 17px; margin: 10px 0 6px; }
  .more-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 700px) { .more-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
